   "summary": "Send the owner a notice, a question (buttons, text reply, choice, links), an HTML card or a live text panel. Prefer a native question for simple choices, normal priority and no speech. Sending isn't seeing or answering: wait with GET /v1/interactions/{id}?wait=55 (or one /v1/events loop for several)",
