   "summary": "Notify the owner again about one of your pending or seen cards. Opening a card clears its alert; only this explicit request restores it. Preserves seen status, answers and expiry; does not open the screen or speak. Closed or expired cards are refused",
   "path": "/v1/interactions/{id}/renotify",
   "method": "POST",
   "documentation": "https://bridgit.cc/learn/operations/post-v1-interactions-id-renotify.json",
