   "control_scope": null,
   "requires_power": null,
   "tool": "interactions_renotify"
  },
  {
   "summary": "Your events, oldest first: answers, closes, expiries, switch changes. interaction.renotified records an explicit card reminder. Repeated phone answers emit interaction.answered with resubmission=true and previous_answer; agents decide whether to accept the change. An answer given after the question expired comes as interaction.answered with late=true. action.executed: one of your HTML cards ran Bridgit.act (interaction_id, method, path, status, ok, error)",
